 married with Lucy.They went to the hospital because a little baby was in Lucy's belly.\r\n  But,when they were on the bus,they saw some rain outside the window.Suddenly,the rain went into the bus!They cried:'Oh,no!'.\r\n  10 minutes later,the water was about 30 cm tall.They were very nervous.\r\n  Then,the bus ran into a problem and can't go anymore.Lucy's tummy was very hurt now.That's sounds not great!\r\n  The rain stopped at last.They went to the hospital which was not far from here.\r\n  They met someone who need help.He looked not very friendly.He took them to 'home'.Oh,no!They are behind the kidnappers now.What a bad day!\r\n\r\n**\u7b54\u9898\u533a**\r\n1.Use T/F to answer these questions.\r\n    (1)They came back to home at last.   ____\r\n    (2)They back to the home by bus.   ____\r\n\r\n2.Choose the best title for this story?  ____\r\nAnswer A:**A Good Day**\r\nAnswer B:**Don't go with good people**\r\nAnswer C:**Don't go with bad people**\r\nAnswer D:**A Rainy Day**\r\n\r\n3.Answer the questions.\r\n    (1)Kidnappers means?   ____________________\r\n    (2)Why did Lucy's tummy hurt?   ____________________\r\n    (3)Was that man helpful?   ____________________\r\n**\u7b54\u6848\u5c06\u5728\u4e0b\u4e00\u7bc7\u9605\u8bfb\u7406\u89e3\u53d1\u5e03\u65f6\u51fa\u5177**\u3002", "top": 0, "createdAt": 1727701477, "style": "", "script": "<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script>", "head": "", "ogImage": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180653357?v=4", "createdDate": "2024-09-30", "dateLabelColor": "#bc4c00"}, "P3": {"htmlDir": "docs/post/ying-yu-yue-du-li-jie-[2.0-2].html", "labels": ["\u82f1\u8bed\u9605\u8bfb\u7406\u89e3"], "postTitle": "\u82f1\u8bed\u9605\u8bfb\u7406\u89e3[2.0-2]", "postUrl": "post/ying-yu-yue-du-li-jie-%5B2.0-2%5D.html", "postSourceUrl": "https://github.com/qingzhu6-13/qingzhu6-13.github.io/issues/3", "commentNum": 0, "wordCount": 1955, "description": "**[2.0-2]\u9605\u8bfb\u533a**\r\n>   Yuanmingyuan Park was very beautiful before 1840s.There we're a lot of beautiful  buildings.But just now,it ruins.In 1840s,The UK and France went into Beijing and rushed into Yuanmingyuan Park.They put a lot of beautiful things on their car.If there were something  they can't  move it,they damaged these things.They sold a lot of beautiful photos,too.On the first in October of 1840s,they used fire to **destroy** Yuanmingyuan Park.All Chinese were very angry and sad.They all liked Yuanmingyuan Park and hate the war very much.So we must protect  our country,or we are going  to die.\r\n\r\n**\u7b54\u9898\u533a**\r\n1.Use T/F to answer these questions.\r\n    (1)Yuanmingyuan Park is very beautiful  today.   ____\r\n    (2)We mustn't protect our country.   ____\r\n    (3)We can delete 's' in '1840s'.   ____\r\n\r\n2.Fill in the blanks.\r\n    All people like 1. very much.But the UK and France 2. it.Just now, 3. .\r\n1.__________________\r\n2.__________________\r\n3.____________________________________\r\n\r\n3.Answer the questions.\r\n    (1)If Yuanmingyuan  Park will rebuild lately,What do you feel?Why?\r\n        ____________________________________.\r\n**prompt:Think about yourself.Which tense will you use?Talk about past and now.\u22653 sentences.**\r\n    (2)Is **destroy** right?If it is right,please tell me why.If it is NOT  right,please change it and tell me why.\r\n        ________________________________________________________________________.\r\n**\u7b54\u6848\u5c06\u5728\u4e0b\u4e00\u7bc7\u9605\u8bfb\u7406\u89e3\u53d1\u5e03\u65f6\u51fa\u5177** \r\n[1.5-1]\u7b54\u6848\uff1a\r\n1.Use T/F to answer these questions.\r\n    (1)They came back to home at last.   F\r\n    (2)They back to the home by bus.   F\r\n\r\n2.Choose the best title for this story?  C\r\nAnswer A:**A Good Day**\r\nAnswer B:**Don't go with good people**\r\nAnswer C:**Don't go with bad people**\r\nAnswer D:**A Rainy Day**\r\n\r\n3.Answer the questions.\r\n    (1)Kidnappers means?  \u52ab\u532a\uff0c\u7ed1\u67b6